{"abstract":"Civil servants conduct the work which makes welfare states functions on an everyday bases: Police men police, school teachers teach, and tax inspectors inspect. Focus in this paper is on the core tasks of tax inspectors. The paper argues that their core task of securing the collection of revenue has remained much the same within the last 10 years. However, how the core task has been organized has changed considerable under the influence of various “organizing devices”. The paper focusses on how organizing devices such as risk assessment, output-focus, effect orientation, and treatment projects influence the organization of core tasks within the tax administration. The paper shows that the organizational transformations based on the use of these devices have had consequences both for the overall collection of revenue and for the employees’ feeling of “making a difference”. All in all, the paper is an investigation into how various (mundane) organizing devices interact with, influence, and shape particular organizational practices which are assumed to perform the well-functioning welfare state.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Boll, Karen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-282214"],"event":{"end":"2012-10-20","place":"Frederiksberg, dk","start":"2012-10-17","title":"The 4S/EASST Joint Conference 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"organizing core tasks","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-282214","ids":["cbs-47ed81dc-3070-4563-bae9-47ad0f9c2cca"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1ADB7DC71BD929A9D0F28CC2493A3798"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Karen","key":"bollpau","last":"Boll","locid":"ea9574f1-23ef-4b7a-956c-dafe20986b54","name":"Boll, Karen","orcid":"0000-0001-9497-4372","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-47ed81dc-3070-4563-bae9-47ad0f9c2cca"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Organizing Core Tasks","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-282214","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
